"""Prospective V2 payload, validation, and publication contract.

Importing this module is outcome-free.  It imports only the frozen V1
scientific contract and defines deterministic JSON authorities and validators;
it never opens a panel, tensor, checkpoint, failed output, or result.

V2 keeps the frozen V1 scientific design while separating one scientific
attempt into an immutable payload producer and an independent regeneration
validator.  Presentation is a third, non-scientific phase which may consume
only that validated payload.
"""

